<title>INDIA: India Vashisti Detergents 1996/97 loss.</title>
<headline>India Vashisti Detergents 1996/97 loss.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997.</p>
<p>	     (in million rupees unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net loss		  60.5	vs     156.3</p>
<p>    Sales		  1,168.5	vs     601.3</p>
<p>    Other income	     1.0	vs	 1.8</p>
<p>    Expenditure	  1,167.0	vs     640.1</p>
<p>    Interest		  23.8	vs	90.4</p>
<p>    Depreciation	    39.2	vs	28.9</p>
<p>    Tax			  nil	vs	 nil</p>
<p>Note: Vashisti Detergents Ltd is part of Hindustan Lever Ltd. The firm said it had retired all its long term debts with financial institutions in accordance with a one-time settlement agreed with them.</p>
<p>-- Bombay equities desk +91-22-265 9000</p>
